abstract: "Leakage-controlled benchmark linking FDA MAUDE adverse event reports (openFDA) to later Class I medical device recalls, with count, disproportionality, recall-history, text and evidence-fusion baselines, the AEGIS evidence-gap retrieval policy, a random-panel analysis at realistic prevalence, and all Kaggle notebooks and results."
